    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market this superb and stunning 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom home c.109 Sqm with attic conversion c. 21 Sqm (not inc in overall)\n\nThis is an excellent family home which has been finished to a high standard and will be sure to appeal to all first-time buyers and also families trading up. The living spaces are bright, airy and flooded with natural light due to its sunny facing aspect. Other notable features include a spacious rear garden, modern contemporary style kitchen, 3 bathrooms and a tasteful decor throughout. There are a number of quality-controlled energy saving features which vastly improve the efficiency of this home, while helping to significantly reduce running costs such as superior levels of insulation, Solar PV systems for electricity savings, GFCH & large high-performance windows.\n\nThe bright and spacious accommodation briefly comprises of an entrance hallway, guest bathroom, living room, open plan kitchen/dining room & utility room. Upstairs there are 3 generous sized bedrooms, master ensuite and a family bathroom. The attic space has been converted c. Sqm comprising of a bedroom and office space. Outside to the rear there is a large & private garden which is ideal for entertaining guests or enjoying a family BBQ. To the front there is a cobble lock driveway which provides off street parking for 2 cars. \n\nThe location is ideal as this home is positioned in an ideal position in the estate with a large green space nearby. Elder Heath enjoys close proximity to The Square Shopping Centre, Tallaght Hospital, Tallaght IT, Luas, Dublin bus services and a selection of schools, pubs and restaurants. There is ease of access to all major roadways to include the M50, M7, N81."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPlease see 3D Tour - \nhttps://my.matterport.com/show/?m=7EYYyzJKSPd\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Superb and Stunning 3 bed 3 bath home in fantastic condition</li><li> Circa 109 sqm + Attic 21 sqm</li><li> BER B</li><li> Wonderful location</li><li> Large Sunny facing rear garden scope to extend</li><li> GFCH & DG windows</li><li> PV Panels</li><li> Off street parking for 2 cars</li><li> Stunning views of the Dublin Mountains</ul>"
      },
